This isolated route loads USAD2-Small from the external model asset directory;
its upstream source code and weights are not redistributed here. It adds
whole-waveform online feature extraction, valid-frame temporal pooling,
explicit training audits, eight-GPU microbatch-eight with four-step gradient
accumulation, and complete-state checkpoints.
Reference source file identities are recorded in reference_audit.json.
